  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the scene of the woman in the coffin",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the scene of the woman in the coffin, as the text 'when your dishwasher is done for good' uses the deictic 'your' to directly address the viewer. This implies the user is the person experiencing the frustration of a broken dishwasher, and the visual of the woman in the coffin is used to represent their emotional state. The projection is onto the scene entity 'woman_in_coffin', which serves as the visual embodiment of the user's imagined reaction to appliance failure.",
